{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段那种克制、易碎的亲近在这里渐渐放开，变成更充盈、更坦然的投入；满足仍然带着珍惜，却不再一直缩在“它能不能让我安心”的顾虑里。到这里，人有一种被眼前这份好本身带走的感觉，自己的不安暂时退到了较远的位置。\",\"thread\":\"前面已经经历过：即使得不到保证，这份亲近仍然是真的，也仍然能够给予满足。既然它的价值已经不再靠“能否安顿一切”来证明，此刻便不必一边感受它、一边不断防备它的限度。于是原先小心保存的满足能够真正展开：不是因为未解决的问题得到了回答，而是这一刻得到的东西已经足够充分，使人暂时不再以自己的缺憾衡量它。\",\"used\":\"第4段已经显出满足不能提供全部保证；第5段确认更用力地在乎也换不来保证；第6段进一步确认，即使如此，亲近和满足仍然可以真实成立。\",\"new\":[\"一份体验在不提供保证的情况下，也可能充分到使人暂时不再以自己的未满足为中心。\",\"先前克制地珍惜的东西，一旦不再承担“必须使我安心”的任务，就能够被更完整、更坦然地承受。\"],\"unexplained\":\"这种充盈之中是否仍潜藏着某种更具体的缺失，在这一段本身还没有显清楚。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1802a905-a37f-4513-980c-f3dc2e90d9eb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224904175860Z", "elapsed_seconds": 30.765, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:49:34.955633+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e6ebe12edca2222b18a9a66b69a799690931c48d55de821abdc6983bdca2df5d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42